  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'How do you simplify a surd such as √50?', 'Extract the largest square factor: √50 = √(25 × 2) = 5√2.', 1),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'How do you rationalise a denominator of the form a + √b?', 'Multiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate a − √b, using the difference of two squares to clear the surd.', 2),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Is √(a + b) equal to √a + √b?', 'No. The product rule holds but the sum rule does not: √(9 + 16) = 5 while √9 + √16 = 7.', 3),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'State the laws of indices for multiplication, division and powers.', 'xᵃ × xᵇ = x^(a+b), xᵃ ÷ xᵇ = x^(a−b). (xᵃ)ᵇ = x^(ab).', 4),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'What are x⁰, x^(−a) and x^(m/n)?', 'x⁰ = 1 for x ≠ 0, x^(−a) = 1/xᵃ, x^(m/n) = (ⁿ√x)^m — take the root first to keep the numbers small.', 5),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Simplify √12 + √27.', '2√3 + 3√3 = 5√3.', 6),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Rationalise 1/(√3 − 1).', 'Multiply top and bottom by (√3 + 1): (√3 + 1)/(3 − 1) = (√3 + 1)/2.', 7),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Evaluate 8^(2/3).', '(∛8)² = 2² = 4.', 8),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Evaluate 16^(−3/4).', '1/(⁴√16)³ = 1/2³ = 1/8.', 9),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Simplify x³ × x⁵.', 'x⁸ (add the powers).', 10),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Simplify (x²)⁴.', 'x⁸ (multiply the powers).', 11),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Simplify x⁷ ÷ x³.', 'x⁴ (subtract the powers).', 12),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Simplify (2x³)².', '4x⁶.', 13),
  ('Mathematics', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', 'P1', 'Algebraic Expressions', 'Write 1/x³ as a power of x.', 'x⁻³.', 14),
