  ('Mathematics', 'OCR B', 'alevel', '3.5', 'Forces', 'A 5 kg block rests on a rough horizontal surface with μ = 0.4. What is the maximum friction?', 'F = 0.4 × 5 × 9.8 = 19.6 N.', 7),
